on right click:
    event-block is gray stained glass
    player's tool is lime concrete
    cancel event
    remove 1 lime concrete from player's tool
    set event-block to lime concrete
    play sound "block.stone.place" at event-block with volume 1 and pitch 1

on right click:
    event-block is lime concrete
    cancel event
    set event-block to gray stained glass
    give player 1 lime concrete
    play sound "block.stone.break" at event-block with volume 1 and pitch 1